@startuml
title Project Resource Allocation & Labor Cost Tracking Workflow

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #0f172a
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #f8fafc
skinparam ActivityFontColor #0f172a
skinparam ActivityFontSize 12
skinparam ActivityFontStyle bold

skinparam SwimlaneBorderColor #1d4ed8
skinparam SwimlaneWidth 220
skinparam SwimlaneTitleFontColor #1e3a8a
skinparam SwimlaneTitleFontSize 14
skinparam SwimlaneTitleFontStyle bold

skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5

|Project Manager|
start
:Create Project Workspace & Set Financial Budget;

|Department Manager|
:Allocate Team Member Capacities & Hourly Rates;

|Employee|
:Log Daily Worked Hours per Project Task;

|Project Manager|
:Review & Approve Billable Timesheet Hours;
:Compute Labor Cost vs Client Revenue;
if (Budget Overrun Warning?) then (Exceeded)
  :Adjust Team Member Capacity Allocation;
else (Normal)
  :Generate Draft Client Billing Invoice;
endif

|Department Manager|
:Sign Off Invoice & Transmit to Client Accounting;
stop
@enduml
